>From: zeno@deltanet.com (Zeno)
>I have the lists from the following sites:
>    http://www.lojban.org/files/wordlists/gismu
>    http://www.lojban.org/files/wordlists/cmavo
>    http://www.lojban.org/files/wordlists/lujvo-list
